<title>USA: Noodle Kidoodle gets $15 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Noodle Kidoodle gets $15 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noodle Kidoodle Inc said Tuesday that it has a new, $15 million, three year revolving credit facility with CIT Group/Business Credit Inc.</p>
<p>This facility will be used for direct borrowings and letters of credit and will be secured by the company's inventory.</p>
</text>
